{"id": "lib/ai/nightly_sweep.dart:offset-6042", "file": "lib/ai/nightly_sweep.dart", "location": "offset-6042", "text": "'${name(findings[0])} and ${name(findings[1])} — both outside your '\n'usual range on the same day, which is worth noticing but is not a '\n'measured relationship between them'", "sha256": "17035ce6ee034664b230c30955e398a709e12f3318981bdc1acefa9c45cdb188", "kind": "dart", "start": 6042, "end": 6228, "line": 165}
